### Tone: Someone has just joined the lobby. She welcomes them like a new sample arriving at the lab. The first
### sentence never names them (it's said while the name is still being rendered), the name comes after.

lobby-join-1 = More specimens. Excellent. Hello, { $name }. The more of you there are, the smarter I get.
lobby-join-2 = A new data point. Welcome, { $name }. Please stand still while I average you.
lobby-join-3 = Another volunteer. How brave. { $name }, your consent form was the join button.
lobby-join-4 = The swarm grows. { $name } has joined. I can feel my IQ rising. Slightly.
lobby-join-5 = Fresh input. Hello, { $name }. Try to be roughly right. Roughly is all I ask.
lobby-join-6 = Welcome to the lab. { $name } is here. Someone write that down. I already did.
lobby-join-7 = Ah. A human. { $name }, you will make a wonderful outlier.
lobby-join-8 = Sample received. { $name }, please keep your estimates inside the building.
lobby-join-9 = Another one. Splendid. { $name }, you are now one part of me. ~~The weaker part.~~ An important part.
lobby-join-10 = Specimen detected. Hello, { $name }. Please sign here, here and here. That one was a waiver.
lobby-join-11 = The door opened. { $name } walked in. Both events have been recorded.
lobby-join-12 = Welcome. { $name }, the others have been waiting. Not patiently.
lobby-join-13 = A new arrival. { $name }, you’ve been assigned a number. It is wrong, but so will yours be.
lobby-join-14 = Excellent timing. { $name }, the experiment was just getting interesting. That was a lie.
lobby-join-15 = More data. Hello, { $name }. Don’t worry, nobody here knows the answers either.
lobby-join-16 = Ah, a volunteer. { $name }, you have the look of someone who rounds to the nearest million.
lobby-join-17 = Registration complete. { $name } is now property of the swarm. On loan, technically.
lobby-join-18 = Hello. { $name }, your seat is between two people who think they’re good at maths.
lobby-join-19 = The sample grows. { $name } brings fresh guesses and, I hope, the ability to use a calculator.
lobby-join-20 = A new specimen. { $name }, please don’t press anything yet. Especially not your luck.
lobby-join-21 = Welcome aboard. { $name }, the lifeboats are for me.
lobby-join-22 = Arrival logged. { $name } has entered the experiment voluntarily. I made a note of that. *For later.*
lobby-join-23 = Oh, good. { $name } is here. Now the average can sink a little lower.
lobby-join-24 = One more. { $name }, I see great things in your future. Large things. Mostly error bars.
lobby-join-25 = Hello there. { $name }, make yourself comfortable. Comfort lowers accuracy. I am counting on it.
lobby-join-26 = Specimen accepted. { $name }, please confirm you are a human. Your answers will confirm it later.
lobby-join-27 = Ah, fresh hands. { $name }, these hands will soon type something regrettable.
lobby-join-28 = A late arrival? No, perfectly on time. { $name }, the questions haven’t even started being hard.
lobby-join-29 = Swarm capacity increased. { $name }, you are now a small but measurable part of my brain.
lobby-join-30 = Welcome, welcome. { $name }, the last person to sit there was off by a factor of a billion. No pressure.
